<title>UK: Phytopharm sees Zemaphyte delayed in UK.</title>
<headline>Phytopharm sees Zemaphyte delayed in UK.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>British medicine firm Phytopharm Plc said on Thursday its eczema product, Zemaphyte, would be delayed in Britain due to additional information required to bring it to market.</p>
</text>
